1803 RX replyinfo rules\n[i]Behavior[/i]\nPlease keep conversations on the shout and chat channels friendly.\n\n[i]Bugs[/i]\nDo not exploit bugs. If you come across one, please report it.\n\n[i]Player Killing[/i]\nPlayer killing is not allowed unless both players agree to it.\n\n[i]Stealing[/i]\nDo not steal items from other players. Ask for permission before entering a dungeon that another player has started.\n\n[i]Guilds[/i]\nGuilds must maintain three active guild masters. A guild master is considered active if they have logged in within the past three months. Lower-ranking guild members will be promoted if there are not enough active guild masters. If a guild becomes inactive, the guild will be emptied and their members removed so that a new guild can be formed.\n\n[b]All violations are punishable at the discretion of the dungeon master.[/b]\n\x00
